# Raycast's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-raycast-setting-cookie = Sign in at https://www.raycast.com/settings, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies > https://www.raycast.com, and copy __raycast_session (and csrf_token when present) as one "__raycast_session=value; csrf_token=value" header.
